# Brainsurge: "Draw four cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order." Bot1 draws exactly
# four (Lightning Bolt, Counterspell, Dark Ritual, Mox Jet: after the spell two of them are in hand) and puts two of them
# back with Counterspell chosen first and Lightning Bolt last, so Lightning Bolt is the top card and Counterspell the one
# under it - the last chosen ends on top. Hand 8 - 2 = 6, library 8 + 2 = 10.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Brainsurge
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Dark Ritual
Mox Jet
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brainsurge.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Counterspell; Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Library = Lightning Bolt; Counterspell; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Brainsurge
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Island; Mox Sapphire
